=2 Walkthrough
* Ask {n:Chululu} to test your compatibility with another player on 3 different game days.
** To test compatibility, type the name of nearby player as the password.
* Speak to her one game day after testing your compatibility 3 times and she will give you this quest.
** If she mentions "spreading the wonder of tarut cards", then that's the wrong quest ({q:All in the Cards|All in the Cards|All in the Cards}). Say no and talk to her again.
* {n:Chululu} gives you {@k} {k:Magic trash}.
* The {@k} {k:Magic trash} can only be disposed of in the Incinerator in {z:Garlaige Citadel}.
* To access the Incinerator, you need a {@i:Garlaige Key|502} {i:Garlaige Key|Garlaige Key|502}
** The key is dropped by {m:Fallen Evacuee} in {z:Garlaige Citadel}. Found in the rooms right near the entrance to the zone on Map 1.
* To reach the Incinerator, pass through the first two Banishing Gates in {z:Garlaige Citadel}.
* After you get through the Second Banishing Gate, go to (I-7) on the map (3) and trade your key to the **Crematory Hatch** to enter the Incinerator Room.
* Speak with {n:Mashira} who will dispose of the trash for you.
* Return to {n:Chululu} for your reward.

!Garlaige Citadel-map1.jpg||Map 1
!Garlaige Citadel-map2.jpg||Map 2
